contains($Mapper7/ns10:NumeriTelefonici[$index1]/ns10:NomeReferente,'dk')) and $VisualizzazioneNotificheOperationIn.Input/tns:DatiNotifiche[$index]/tns:isOLO=false())]]></bpws:transitionCondition>
